# Copy to `.env` next to `server.mjs` for local runs (`npm start`), or use systemd
# `EnvironmentFile=/etc/yoochog/realtime.env` on the server (see `deploy/systemd/yoochog-realtime.service`).
#
# Shared secret: guests who enable “session admin login” on their device enter this on the join page;
# the realtime server checks it and tells the host to add their logical guest id as a session admin.

# PARTY_ADMIN_PASSWORD=
